cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this database, please cite the paper that describes it
  (preferred citation below), and also cite the original studies whose data
  you use (each study's citation and DOI are provided in the database). The
  Zenodo DOI is the dataset itself; cite it to name an exact version.
title: "The Liking Initiative: a database of subjective evaluation ratings for decision-making research"
type: dataset
